<title>USA: IAT Multimedia sets share repurchase plan.</title>
<headline>IAT Multimedia sets share repurchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>IAT Multimedia Inc said Thursday its board had authorized a plan to buy back up to 300,000 shares.</p>
<p>The company said it has already repurchased 50,000 shares as part of the plan.</p>
<p>&quot;We have authorized these purchases based on the company's belief that the common stock is under-priced,&quot; Viktor Vogt, co-chairman, said in a statement.</p>
</text>
